      "comment": "BASH BOY GIBLET (6) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 1.3 lengths at this track in a handy 24.10 beating Complete. Can continue the winning form. SCOTT ALIFEROUS (1) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 4.5 lengths (24.60) at this track. One of the main contenders. MADE EASY (2) was quickly into stride and raced on speed before sticking on for a minor placing third (19.45) at Healesville in Mix 6/7 H. Has failed to finish in the placings from four starts here. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Expected to be in this for a long way. BROTHER EASY (3) bold run expected on best form.",
